:HELP NAME=APYJRNCHG.Apply Journaled Changes (APYJRNCHG)
:P.Use the Apply Journaled Changes (APYJRNCHG) command to apply
journaled changes to files from a range of entries.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/JRN'.Journal (JRN)
:P.The journal, by name and library.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/FILE'.Journaled file (FILE)
:P.The file, by name and library.
:P.Up to 300 values can be given.
:PARML.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *ALLFILE.
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. File
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Member
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*FIRST:EPK.
:PD.The first one.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/RCVRNG'.Range of journal receivers (RCVRNG)
:P.The range of journal receivers for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*CURRENT:EPK.
:PD.The current one.
:PT.:PK.*CURCHAIN:EPK.
:PD.The receivers of the current chain.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *LASTSAVE.
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Starting receiver
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Ending receiver
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/FROMENT'.Starting sequence number (FROMENT)
:P.The starting sequence number for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*FIRST:EPK.
:PD.The first one.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a number of up to 20 digits. The value must be from 1 to
18446744073709551600.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *LASTSAVE.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/TOENT'.Ending sequence number (TOENT)
:P.The ending sequence number for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LAST:EPK.
:PD.The last one.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a number of up to 20 digits. The value must be from 1 to
18446744073709551600.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/TOJOBO'.End at job open (TOJOBO)
:P.The end at job open for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.User&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Number&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 6 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/TOJOBC'.End at job close (TOJOBC)
:P.The end at job close for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.User&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Number&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 6 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/FROMTIME'.Starting date and time (FROMTIME)
:P.The starting date and time for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Date
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.date:EPV.
:PD.Type a date in the date format of the job.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Time
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.time:EPV.
:PD.Type a time of day&colon. hours, minutes and seconds.
:EPARML.
:P.When no value is given, 000000 is used.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/TOTIME'.Ending date and time (TOTIME)
:P.The ending date and time for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Date
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.date:EPV.
:PD.Type a date in the date format of the job.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Time
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.time:EPV.
:PD.Type a time of day&colon. hours, minutes and seconds.
:EPARML.
:P.When no value is given, 000000 is used.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/CMTBDY'.Stop at commitment boundary (CMTBDY)
:P.Whether to stop at commitment boundary.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/OBJERROPT'.On object error (OBJERROPT)
:P.The on object error for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*END:EPK.
:PD.The end.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *CONTINUE.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/OUTPUT'.Output (OUTPUT)
:P.Where the command sends what it produces&colon. to the display of an
interactive job, or to a spooled file of the job's printer file. Some
commands can also write it to a database file.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PK.*OUTFILE:EPK.
:PD.The output goes to the database file named by OUTFILE.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/OUTFILE'.File to receive output (OUTFILE)
:P.The database file that receives the output when OUTPUT(*OUTFILE) is
given. The file is created with the system's model format when it does
not exist.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='APYJRNCHG/OUTMBR'.Output member options (OUTMBR)
:P.The member of the output file that receives the records, and whether
they replace the member's records or are added after them.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Member to receive output
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*FIRST:EPK.
:PD.The first member of the file. A member with the file's name is added
when the file has none.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Replace or add records
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*REPLACE:EPK.
:PD.The member's records are cleared first.
:PT.:PK.*ADD:EPK.
:PD.The records are added after the member's records.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGJRN.Change Journal (CHGJRN)
:P.Use the Change Journal (CHGJRN) command to attach a new receiver to a
journal or change its attributes.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGJRN/JRN'.Journal (JRN)
:P.The journal, by name and library.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGJRN/JRNRCV'.Journal receiver (JRNRCV)
:P.The journal receiver, by name and library.
:P.Up to 2 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*GEN:EPK.
:PD.Generated by the system.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
