:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGJRN/SEQOPT'.Sequence option (SEQOPT)
:P.The sequence option for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*CONT:EPK.
:PD.Continuous forms.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *RESET.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGJRN/JRNMSGQ'.Journal message queue (JRNMSGQ)
:P.The journal message queue for this command.
