:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGJRN/RCVSIZOPT'.Receiver size options (RCVSIZOPT)
:P.The receiver size options for this command.
:P.Up to 4 values can be given.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
