:P.Also accepted&colon. *RMVINTENT, *MINFIXLEN, *MAXOPT1, *MAXOPT2,
*MAXOPT3.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGJRN/MINENTDTA'.Minimize entry specific data (MINENTDTA)
:P.The minimize entry specific data for this command.
:P.Up to 3 values can be given.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
